{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119303","id":3641217887,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ZCJNf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119303","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119303.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119303.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119303","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119303/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119303/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119303/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3ffec30d510dd7fe46683b776565f279f0c88bff","number":119303,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix some X11 BadWindow errors not being ignored","user":{"login":"norepro","id":30921834,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTIxODM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30921834?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro","html_url":"https://github.com/norepro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Godot suppresses X11 BadWindow errors during some operations because they can occur with normal usage.\r\n\r\nX11 errors are asynchronous, sometimes dequeuing a BadWindow error after the non-suppressing handler has been restored. This results in an error callstack being shown to the user.\r\n\r\nCall `XSync` before restoring the original error handler. This ensures that any queued BadWindow errors go to the suppressing handler. Performance hit is negligible because this sync is only during embedded process creation and closing.\r\n\r\nOne repro is to start a game with F5 or F6 (scene) and hit Alt+F4 very quickly. The error stack will result if you close it while the embedded process is being created. I was able to hit it about 10% of the time.\r\n\r\nTested on local build with `production=yes`. No obvious performance hit, even with the spamming mentioned above. The bug also never occurred; I tried an embarrassing number of times.\r\n\r\nFixes #117814 \r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-07T06:34:05Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T16:16:55Z","closed_at":"2026-05-07T16:16:40Z","merged_at":"2026-05-07T16:16:40Z","merge_commit_sha":"ee4e7e51bc121ff85e95ac5681200bb9b8b92c01","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"norepro:x11-xsync-badwindow-errors","ref":"x11-xsync-badwindow-errors","repo":{"id":1230613295,"node_id":"R_kgDOSVmrLw","name":"godot","full_name":"norepro/godot","owner":{"login":"norepro","id":30921834,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTIxODM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30921834?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro","html_url":"https://github.com/norep